  "$comment": "Apogee's scenario pool. Owned here: nothing reads a benchmark file to find out what a season is made of. A scenario is identified by the exact name KovaaK's uses, because that is what the player launches and what the leaderboard is keyed on. Edit this file to change the pool; then re-run sample:leaderboards and build:season.",
